.nf
YASMV manual                                                 capabilities

.ti 0
SYNOPSIS

.in 3
capabilities

.ti 0
DESCRIPTION

.fi
.in 3
List the available agent operations and their descriptions.

For machine-readable operation schemas and supported limits, run
"yasmv --capabilities" from the operating-system shell. To submit versioned
JSON Lines requests, run "yasmv --agent --store <directory>". Agent analysis
requests use explicit revision and artifact IDs.

See docs/CLI_WORKBENCH.md for the agent protocol and examples.

.ti 0
EXAMPLES

.nf
.in 3
>> capabilities

.ti 0
SEE ALSO

.fi
.in 3
help workspace, help job.
